# Renet, Temporal Apprentice: "Flash. When Renet enters, return each other nonland permanent that entered this turn to its
# owner's hand." In Bot2's turn two, after Bot2 plays a Forest, casts Llanowar Elves and Mox Ruby, Bot1 flashes in Renet:
# the Elves and the Ruby, both of Bot2's, go back to Bot2's hand; the Forest (a land) stays, and so do Bot1's Mox Jet and
# Mox Sapphire, which entered in turn one, and Renet herself ("other").

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Renet, Temporal Apprentice
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Mox Ruby
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Llanowar Elves; Mox Ruby
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Renet, Temporal Apprentice.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest
Bot2.Hand = Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Llanowar Elves; Mox Ruby
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Sapphire; Renet, Temporal Apprentice
